{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_019SiEGcLAhwq6uY5QxHHYvt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here is a grounded summary of the **rnd-v11 \"Reliable Trio Handoff\"** build session, as bullet claims:\n\n## rnd-v11 â€” Build Trio Session Summary\n\n**Goal / what it fixed**\n- v11 is a correctness fix for a real production failure: advancing a **live research session** to planning never persisted the research docs, so the handoff fell back to a bare \"load Crucible\" prompt with no `HANDOFF.md`.\n- Root cause: `persist_session_docs` (via `capture_session_docs`) ran only inside `terminal_session.kill` and `finish_to_build` â€” never on the live `advance_session` path. The masking trap: v10 tests pre-persisted docs via `record_effort`, so the suite stayed green while the live flow was broken.\n\n**The keystone (the structural fix)**\n- Added `terminal_session.prepare_stage_handoff(project_id, source_session_id, to_lane)` â€” one shared handoff helper that: (1) persists the source session's docs (live or done; idempotent; never raises), (2) builds the real doc-referencing next-stage prompt, (3) resolves doc_rels + correct skill (planningâ†’Crucible, buildâ†’Foreman) + cached summary, (4) triggers a gated non-blocking background summary.\n- Added `handoff.write_handoff_md(...)` â€” generic `HANDOFF.md` listing real persisted upstream paths + read-these-first + skill + optional summary; generalizes the plan-set-only `prime_worktree` to any stage (notably researchâ†’plan, which has no plan set).\n\n**Waves**\n- **Wave 1** â€” keystone + the worktree-only live-flow truth test (`test_stage_handoff_keystone_v11.py`), which fails against pre-fix code.\n- **Wave 2** (the user-facing fix, UI) â€” âœ… GREEN, awaiting John's UI sign-off: `/api/rnd/advance_session` (researchâ†’plan) rewired through the keystone â€” `prepare_stage_handoff(pid, source, 'planning')` â†’ `start_session(paste_prompt=prompt, parent_session_id=source)` â†’ `write_handoff_md` + `write_next_prompt` â†’ `record_stage_link`. Mockup `_mockups/research_to_plan_handoff.html`; new `test_advance_research_to_plan_live_v11.py` (worktree-only backend) + `test_advance_research_to_plan_ui_v11.py` (Playwright, discriminating on a real doc path).\n- **Wave 3** â€” unified the other advance paths (`finish_to_build`, `auto_advance_planning_to_build`, `advance_grass_research_to_plan`) through the keystone; planâ†’build keeps `prime_worktree` for the richer plan-set `HANDOFF.md`.\n- **Wave 4** (PROJECT DONE) â€” `check_rnd_v11_surface` healthcheck walks the real worktree-only flow fully stubbed; masking tests annotated (not weakened); no new CLI seam; Playwright/streaming teardown flake fixed.\n\n**Status**\n- All 4 waves GREEN (1232 passing) on branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v11`, completed 2026-06-20.\n- Not merged / not deployed â€” awaiting John's sign-off, then merge + `nssm restart anchor` (elevated) + rescan.\n\n**The v11 lesson (non-negotiable)**\n- Every advance/handoff test must exercise the worktree-only live flow (write docs into the session's worktree only â€” no `record_effort`, no kill â€” then advance and assert persistence + prompt references). A pre-persisting test is prompt-building coverage, never the sole test of an advance path."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4276,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":80423,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"81f3887b-0dd4-4e0b-babb-f3ab59723eb9","uuid":"c59402a7-3295-4e8f-bd1b-b30273168536","request_id":"req_011CcFSQXGEL6YAvuyyMrxrt"}
